  "summary_en": "Bilingual (English/French) declaration signed by African ministers in Kigali on 4 April 2025. It sets principles and commitments on AI talent, open data, compute, markets, a $60 billion Africa AI Fund, governance harmonisation and an Africa AI Council, emphasising sovereignty, inclusive growth and responsible AI. It has no robotics-specific provisions.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
