   "Endorse an African AI Scientific Panel and an Africa AI Council under Smart Africa",
   "Build open datasets, data governance and regional HPC data centres",
   "Adopt an 'Africa-first' AI procurement approach and AfCFTA regulatory sandbox",
   "Align national AI policies with the AU Continental AI Strategy and harmonise regulation"
